  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/420/241/tiny-pvp-swords-and-tool.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"62\"></p><p><strong>描述</strong></p><p>我制作了这个资源包，用于我的<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/best-pvp\" rel=\"nofollow\">最佳PVP整合包</a>，并决定将其作为独立资源包发布。所有剑的贴图已在Photoshop中裁剪为5x5像素并缩小尺寸。工具的贴图则减少了4x4像素。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>这将进一步改善你的原版游戏体验：更小的武器和工具能提供更大的屏幕视野，对PVP玩法非常有用。所有贴图均来自原版游戏，只是尺寸更小。</p><p>该资源包还包含一个PVP准星。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/420/240/untitled-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/457/563/2022-04-26_22.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即获取服务器，与朋友一起游玩！点击<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>或下方横幅，并使用优惠码<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>可享75折优惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
